th d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-nav\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" class=\"inline-flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-line bg-white text-ink transition-colors hover:border-ocean-300 xl:hidden\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></nav><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-0.5 origin-left bg-linear-to-r from-ocean-600 via-ocean-500 to-ocean-300\" style=\"transform:scaleX(0)\"></div></header><main class=\"flex-1\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"ResearchProject\",\"name\":\"Maridots\",\"url\":\"https://maridots.com\",\"logo\":\"https://maridots.com/logo.png\",\"description\":\"International cross-border technology research initiative into maritime compliance and risk architecture. Jointly developed and managed with administrative oversight in Tunisia. Non-commercial; prototypes are not offered for sale or licence.\",\"email\":\"info@maridots.com\"}</script><section class=\"mesh-dark relative isolate overflow-hidden pb-36\"><img alt=\"A bulk carrier underway on open sea\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover object-center opacity-55\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhero-fleet.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhero-fleet.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhero-fleet.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhero-fleet.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhero-fleet.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhero-fleet.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhero-fleet.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhero-fleet.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhero-fleet.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-r from-rail-900 via-rail-900/88 to-rail-900/25\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"grid-fine-dark absolute inset-0 [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_70%_60%_at_20%_30%,#000,transparent_75%)]\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"animate-drift absolute -top-40 -left-32 size-[34rem] rounded-full bg-ocean-500/25 blur-[140px]\"></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto flex min-h-[40rem] max-w-7xl items-center px-5 pt-24 pb-16 sm:px-8 sm:pt-32\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\"><h1 class=\"display text-[2.6rem] leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-white sm:text-6xl lg:text-[4.25rem]\"><span><span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"inline-block\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(0.85em)\">Streamline</span><span> </span></span><span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"inline-block\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(0.85em)\">Compliance.</span></span></span><br/><span><span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"inline-block text-gradient-ocean\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(0.85em)\">Safeguard</span><span> </span></span><span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"inline-block text-gradient-ocean\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(0.85em)\">Your</span><span> </span></span><span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"inline-block\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(0.85em)\">Assets.</span></span></span></h1><p class=\"mt-7 max-w-xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px)\">A research initiative into one controlled record of fleet compliance and risk — certificates, audits, CAPA, and permits, with the guidance and archived evidence behind them. The prototypes shown here are internal R&amp;D, published for technical discussion with maritime practitioners.</p><div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px)\"><a href=\"#contact\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-ocean-600 px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-[0_18px_40px_-16px_rgba(2,132,199,0.9)] transition-colors hover:bg-ocean-500\">Write to the research team<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"#modules\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/5 px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white backdrop-blur-sm transition-colors hover:border-white/40 hover:bg-white/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-play size-3.5 fill-current\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 5a2 2 0 0 1 3.008-1.728l11.997 6.998a2 2 0 0 1 .003 3.458l-12 7A2 2 0 0 1 5 19z\"></path></svg>See the research prototypes</a></div><div class=\"mt-12 flex items-center gap-3 text-xs tracking-wide text-slate-400\" style=\"opacity:0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down size-4 animate-bounce\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg>Built around ISM, STCW, MARPOL, MLC and ISPS workflows</div></div></div></section><section aria-label=\"What Maridots stands for\" class=\"relative z-10 -mt-24 px-5 pb-16 sm:px-8\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl\"><div class=\"glass-light grid overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-white/90 shadow-[0_30px_70px_-45px_rgba(15,23,42,0.75)] sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5\"><div class=\"group relative border-b border-line-soft last:border-b-0 sm:border-r sm:[&amp;:nth-child(2n)]:border-r-0 lg:border-b-0 lg:[&amp;:nth-child(2n)]:border-r lg:last:border-r-0\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"h-full px-6 py-7 transition-colors group-hover:bg-ocean-50/40\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-0.5 origin-left scale-x-0 bg-linear-to-r from-ocean-500 to-ocean-300 transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-x-100\"></span><span class=\"inline-flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-ocean-50 text-ocean-600 ring-1 ring-ocean-100 transition-colors group-hover:bg-ocean-600 group-hover:text-white group-hover:ring-ocean-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-check size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path><path d=\"m9 15 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold text-ink\">Compliance</h3><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-[13px] leading-6 text-ink-subtle\">Certificates, audits, and regulatory control in one system</p></div></div><div class=\"group relative border-b border-line-soft last:border-b-0 sm:border-r sm:[&amp;:nth-child(2n)]:border-r-0 lg:border-b-0 lg:[&amp;:nth-child(2n)]:border-r lg:last:border-r-