\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-radar size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19.07 4.93A10 10 0 0 0 6.99 3.34\"></path><path d=\"M4 6h.01\"></path><path d=\"M2.29 9.62A10 10 0 1 0 21.31 8.35\"></path><path d=\"M16.24 7.76A6 6 0 1 0 8.23 16.67\"></path><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path><path d=\"M17.99 11.66A6 6 0 0 1 15.77 16.67\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"m13.41 10.59 5.66-5.66\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold text-ink\">Risk management</h3><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-[13px] leading-6 text-ink-subtle\">Snap Hazards → Reports → CAPA → Bowtie / Fishbone → PTW</p></div></div><div class=\"group relative border-b border-line-soft last:border-b-0 sm:border-r sm:[&amp;:nth-child(2n)]:border-r-0 lg:border-b-0 lg:[&amp;:nth-child(2n)]:border-r lg:last:border-r-0\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"h-full px-6 py-7 transition-colors group-hover:bg-ocean-50/40\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-0.5 origin-left scale-x-0 bg-linear-to-r from-ocean-500 to-ocean-300 transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-x-100\"></span><span class=\"inline-flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-ocean-50 text-ocean-600 ring-1 ring-ocean-100 transition-colors group-hover:bg-ocean-600 group-hover:text-white group-hover:ring-ocean-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-blocks size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 22V7a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-5a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H2\"></path><rect x=\"14\" y=\"2\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold text-ink\">High flexibility</h3><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-[13px] leading-6 text-ink-subtle\">Modular research scopes, fleet-to-bureau workspace perspectives</p></div></div><div class=\"group relative border-b border-line-soft last:border-b-0 sm:border-r sm:[&amp;:nth-child(2n)]:border-r-0 lg:border-b-0 lg:[&amp;:nth-child(2n)]:border-r lg:last:border-r-0\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"h-full px-6 py-7 transition-colors group-hover:bg-ocean-50/40\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-0.5 origin-left scale-x-0 bg-linear-to-r from-ocean-500 to-ocean-300 transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-x-100\"></span><span class=\"inline-flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-ocean-50 text-ocean-600 ring-1 ring-ocean-100 transition-colors group-hover:bg-ocean-600 group-hover:text-white group-hover:ring-ocean-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold text-ink\">Appreciated security</h3><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-[13px] leading-6 text-ink-subtle\">RBAC, signed approvals, PIN-authenticated high-liability actions, full traceability</p></div></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><ul class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2\"><li class=\"rounded-full bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted ring-1 ring-line transition-colors hover:text-ocean-700 hover:ring-ocean-200\">30/60/90 expiry watch</li><li class=\"rounded-full bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted ring-1 ring-line transition-colors hover:text-ocean-700 hover:ring-ocean-200\">Offline-capable audits</li><li class=\"rounded-full bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted ring-1 ring-line transition-colors hover:text-ocean-700 hover:ring-ocean-200\">AI-assisted insights</li><li class=\"rounded-full bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted ring-1 ring-line transition-colors hover:text-ocean-700 hover:ring-ocean-200\">Smart migration</li></ul></div></div></section><section id=\"solution\" class=\"relative py-24 sm:py-32\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 sm:px-8\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ocean-700\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-px w-8 bg-ocean-400\"></span>The solution</p><h2 class=\"display mt-4 text-[2rem] leading-[1.12] tracking-tight sm:text-[2.6rem] text-ink\">Shore and vessel working from the same source of truth</h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-ink-muted\">Fleet compliance fails in the gaps: a certificate tracked in a spreadsheet, a near-miss reported by email, a corrective action closed without evidence. The Maridots research prototypes explore how those gaps close when the entire compliance and risk record sits in one controlled system.</p></div><div class=\"mt-16 grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.95fr_1.05fr] lg:gap-16\"><div class=\"lg:sticky lg:top-28 lg:self-start\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><div class=\"relative\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute -inset-3 -z-10 rounded-[1.75rem] bg-linear-to-br from-ocean-200/70 via-transparent to-ocean-100/60 blur-xl\"></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-line shadow-[0_30px_60px_-40px_rgba(15,23,42,0.6)]\"><img alt=\"A deck officer monitoring navigation displays on a ship&#x27;s bridge\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1024px) 45vw, 100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fbridge-operations.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fbridge-operations.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fbridge-operations.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fbridge-operations.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fbridge-operations.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fbridge-operations.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fbridge-operations.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fbridge-operations.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fbridge-operations.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fbridge-operations.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"glass absolute right-4 bottom-4 left-4 rounded-xl px-4 py-3\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-white\">Captured at the point of work</p><p class=\"mt-0.5 text-[11px] leading-5 text-slate-300\">Geo-tagged, timestamped, routed to the DPA on submission.</p></div></div></div></div><ol class=\"relative space-y-4 border-l border-line pl-6 lg:pl-8\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><li class=\"relative\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute top-8 -left-[1.9rem] size-3 rounded-full border-2 border-white bg-ocean-500 shadow-[0_0_0_4px_rgba(2,132,199,0.14)] lg:-left-[2.4rem]\"></span><div class=\"spotlight card card-interactive p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"inline-flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-ocean-50 text-ocean-600 ring-1 ring-ocean-100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-anchor size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 6v16\"></path><path d=\"m19 13 2-1a9 9 0 0 1-18 0l2 1\"></path><path d=\"M9 11h6\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"4\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></span><span class=\"display text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-ocean-600/70\">01</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-5 text-xl font-semibold text-ink\">The vessel reality</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 leading-7 text-ink-muted\">Masters and officers record hazards, permits, rest hours, and audit findings where the work happens — on deck and in the engine room. Audits run and complete with limited connectivity, then sync when the vessel is back online.</p></div></li></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><li class=\"relative\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute top-8 -left-[1.9rem] size-3 rounded-full border-2 border-white bg-ocean-500 shadow-[0_0_0_4px_rgba(2,132,199,0.14)] lg:-left-[2.4rem]\"></span><div class=\"spotlight card card-interactive p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"inline-flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-ocean-50 text-ocean-600 ring-1 ring-ocean-100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-building-complex lucide-building-2 size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 12h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 8h4\"></path><path d=\"M14 21v-3a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v3\"></path><path d=\"M6 10H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2\"></path><path d=\"M6 21V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"display text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-ocean-600/70\">02</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-5 text-xl font-semibold text-ink\">The shore reality</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 leading-7 text-ink-muted\">DPAs, quality managers, and superintendents triage what arrives, assign corrective actions, and verify closure against the same evidence the vessel submitted.</p></div></li></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><li class=\"relative\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute top-8 -left-[1.9rem] size-3 rounded-full border-2 border-white bg-ocean-500 shadow-[0_0_0_4px_rgba(2,132,199,0.14)] lg:-left-[2.4rem]\"></span><div class=\"spotlight card card-interactive p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"inline-flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-ocean-50 text-ocean-600 ring-1 ring-ocean-100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder-check size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 20a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-7.9a2 2 0 0 1-1.69-.9L9.6 3.9A2 2 0 0 0 7.93 3H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v13a2 2 0 0 0 2 2Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 13 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"display text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-ocean-600/70\">03</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-5 text-xl font-semibold text-ink\">One defensible record</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 leading-7 text-ink-muted\">Every certificate, finding, approval, and signature lands in a single archive with attribution and timestamps, so an audit request is a search rather than a scramble.</p></div></li></div></ol></div></div></section><section id=\"modules\" class=\"border-y border-line bg-white py-24 sm:py-32\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 sm:px-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-6\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ocean-700\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-px w-8 bg-ocean-400\"></span>Modules</p><h2 class=\"display mt-4 text-[2rem] leading-[1.12] tracking-tight sm:text-[2.6rem] text-ink\">The Maridots research prototype map</h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-ink-muted\">Each pillar below is an internal R&amp;D prototype built to test a compliance or risk workflow with practitioners. Select a pillar to see what the prototype covers. Nothing here is offered for licence or sale.</p></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><p class=\"hidden text-sm text-ink-subtle lg:block\">10<!-- --> module groups ·<!-- --> <!-- -->50<!-- --> modules</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-14 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[22rem_1fr] lg:gap-8\"><div class=\"min-w-0\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><div role=\"tablist\" aria-orientation=\"vertical\" aria-label=\"Module groups\" class=\"flex gap-2 overflow-x-auto pb-2 lg:flex-col lg:overflow-visible lg:pb-0\"><button role=\"tab\" id=\"module-tab-executive\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"module-panel-executive\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"relative flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-left transition-colors lg:w-full text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\"><span class=\"relative z-10 inline-flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg ring-1 transition-colors bg-canvas text-ocean-600 ring-line\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layout-dashboard size-4.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"7\" height=\"9\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"7\" height=\"5\" x=\"14\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"7\" height=\"9\" x=\"14\" y=\"12\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"7\" height=\"5\" x=\"3\" y=\"16\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg></span><span class=\"relative z-10 flex-1\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-semibold whitespace-nowrap lg:whitespace-normal\">Executive Dashboard</span><span class=\"mt-0.5 hidden text-xs text-ink-subtle lg:block\">4<!-- --> modules</span></span></button><button role=\"tab\" id=\"module-tab-assets\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"module-panel-assets\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"relative flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-left transition-colors lg:w-full text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\"><span class=\"relative z-10 inline-flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg ring-1 transition-colors bg-canvas text-ocean-600 ring-line\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-boxes size-4.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.97 12.92A2 2 0 0 0 2 14.63v3.24a2 2 0 0 0 .97 1.71l3 1.8a2 2 0 0 0 2.06 0L12 19v-5.5l-5-3-4.03 2.42Z\"></path><path d=\"m7 16.5-4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"m7 16.5 5-3\"></path><path d=\"M7 16.5v5.17\"></path><path d=\"M12 13.5V19l3.97 2.38a2 2 0 0 0 2.06 0l3-1.8a2 2 0 0 0 .97-1.71v-3.24a2 2 0 0 0-.97-1.71L17 10.5l-5 3Z\"></path><path d=\"m17 16.5-5-3\"></path><path d=\"m17 16.5 4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"M17 16.5v5.17\"></path><path d=\"M7.97 4.42A2 2 0 0 0 7 6.13v4.37l5 3 5-3V6.13a2 2 0 0 0-.97-1.71l-3-1.8a2 2 0 0 0-2.06 0l-3 1.8Z\"></path><path d=\"M12 8 7.26 5.15\"></path><path d=\"m12 8 4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"M12 13.5V8\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"relative z-10 flex-1\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-semibold whitespace-nowrap lg:whitespace-normal\">Asset Management</span><span class=\"mt-0.5 hidden text-xs text-ink-subtle lg:block\">3<!-- --> modules</span></span></button><button role=\"tab\" id=\"module-tab-crewing\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"module-panel-crewing\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"relative flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-left transition-colors lg:w-full text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\"><span class=\"relative z-10 inline-flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg ring-1 transition-colors bg-canvas text-ocean-600 ring-line\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users size-4.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></span><span class=\"relative z-10 flex-1\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-semibold whitespace-nowrap lg:whitespace-normal\">Crewing Management</span><span class=\"mt-0.5 hidden text-xs text-ink-subtle lg:block\">3<!-- --> modules</span></span></button><button role=\"tab\" id=\"module-tab-risk\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"module-panel-risk\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"relative flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-left transition-colors lg:w-full text-ink\"><span class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-xl border border-ocean-200 bg-ocean-50\"></span><span class=\"relative z-10 inline-flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg ring-1 transition-colors bg-ocean-600 text-white ring-ocean-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-alert size-4.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"M12 8v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 16h.01\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"relative z-10 flex-1\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-semibold whitespace-nowrap lg:whitespace-normal\">Risk Management</span><span class=\"mt-0.5 hidden text-xs text-ink-subtle lg:block\">8<!-- --> modules</span></span><span class=\"relative z-10 hidden rounded-full bg-ocean-600/10 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wide text-ocean-700 uppercase lg:inline\">Core</span></button><button role=\"tab\" id=\"module-tab-compliance\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"module-panel-compliance\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"relative flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-left transition-colors lg:w-full text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\"><span class=\"relative z-10 inline-flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg ring-1 transition-colors bg-canvas text-ocean-600 ring-line\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check size-4.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"relative z-10 flex-1\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-semibold whitespace-nowrap lg:whitespace-normal\">Compliance &amp; Safety</span><span class=\"mt-0.5 hidden text-xs text-ink-subtle lg:block\">11<!-- --> modules</span></span><span class=\"relative z-10 hidden rounded-full bg-ocean-600/10 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wide text-ocean-700 uppercase lg:inline\">Core</span></button><button role=\"tab\" id=\"module-tab-knowledge\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"module-panel-knowledge\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"relative flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-left transition-colors lg:w-full text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\"><span class=\"relative z-10 inline-flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg ring-1 transition-colors bg-canvas text-ocean-600 ring-line\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-library size-4.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m16 6 4 14\"></path><path d=\"M12 6v14\"></path><path d=\"M8 8v12\"></path><path d=\"M4 4v16\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"relative z-10 flex-1\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-semibold whitespace-nowrap lg:whitespace-normal\">Knowledge &amp; Reference</span><span class=\"mt-0.5 hidden text-xs text-ink-subtle lg:block\">5<!-- --> modules</span></span></button><button role=\"tab\" id=\"module-tab-bureau\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"module-panel-bureau\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"relative flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-left transition-colors lg:w-full text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\"><span class=\"relative z-10 inline-flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg ring-1 transition-colors bg-canvas text-ocean-600 ring-line\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-building size-4.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 10h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 14h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 6h.01\"></path><path d=\"M16 10h.01\"></path><path d=\"M16 14h.01\"></path><path d=\"M16 6h.01\"></path><path d=\"M8 10h.01\"></path><path d=\"M8 14h.01\"></path><path d=\"M8 6h.01\"></path><path d=\"M9 22v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h4a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><rect x=\"4\" y=\"2\" width=\"16\" height=\"20\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></span><span class=\"relative z-10 flex-1\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-semibold whitespace-nowrap lg:whitespace-normal\">Consultancy Bureau</span><span class=\"mt-0.5 hidden text-xs text-ink-subtle lg:block\">6<!-- --> modules</span></span></button><button role=\"tab\" id=\"module-tab-notifications\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"module-panel-notifications\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"relative flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-left transition-colors lg:w-full text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\"><span class=\"relative z-10 inline-flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg ring-1 transition-colors bg-canvas text-ocean-600 ring-line\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bell-ring size-4.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.268 21a2 2 0 0 0 3.464 0\"></path><path d=\"M22 8c0-2.3-.8-4.3-2-6\"></path><path d=\"M3.262 15.326A1 1 0 0 0 4 17h16a1 1 0 0 0 .74-1.673C19.41 13.956 18 12.499 18 8A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 4.499-1.411 5.956-2.738 7.326\"></path><path d=\"M4 2C2.8 3.7 2 5.7 2 8\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"relative z-10 flex-1\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-semibold whitespace-nowrap lg:whitespace-normal\">Notifications &amp; Alerts</span><span class=\"mt-0.5 hidden text-xs text-ink-subtle lg:block\">2<!-- --> modules</span></span></button><button role=\"tab\" id=\"module-tab-integrations\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"module-panel-integrations\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"relative flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-left transition-colors lg:w-full text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\"><span class=\"relative z-10 inline-flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg ring-1 transition-colors bg-canvas text-ocean-600 ring-line\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-database size-4.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" rx=\"9\" ry=\"3\"></ellipse><path d=\"M3 5V19A9 3 0 0 0 21 19V5\"></path><path d=\"M3 12A9 3 0 0 0 21 12\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"relative z-10 flex-1\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-semibold whitespace-nowrap lg:whitespace-normal\">Integrations &amp; Data Hub</span><span class=\"mt-0.5 hidden text-xs text-ink-subtle lg:block\">4<!-- --> modules</span></span></button><button role=\"tab\" id=\"module-tab-enterprise\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"module-panel-enterprise\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"relative flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-left transition-colors lg:w-full text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\"><span class=\"relative z-10 inline-flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg ring-1 transition-colors bg-canvas text-ocean-600 ring-line\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check size-4.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"relative z-10 flex-1\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-semibold whitespace-nowrap lg:whitespace-normal\">Enterprise Controls</span><span class=\"mt-0.5 hidden text-xs text-ink-subtle lg:block\">4<!-- --> modules</span></span></button></div></div><div class=\"min-w-0\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"module-panel-risk\" aria-labelledby=\"module-tab-risk\" class=\"card relative h-full overflow-hidden p-8\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute -top-24 -right-16 size-64 rounded-full bg-ocean-100/60 blur-3xl\"></div><div class=\"relative flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-4\"><div><h3 class=\"display text-2xl text-ink\">Risk Management</h3><p class=\"mt-2 max-w-xl text-ink-muted\">From the hazard on deck to the verified barrier ashore.</p></div><span class=\"rounded-full bg-ocean-600 px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-wider text-white uppercase\">Core pillar</span></div><div class=\"relative mt-7 space-y-7\"><div><ul class=\"grid gap-2.5 sm:grid-cols-2\"><li class=\"group flex items-start gap-2.5 rounded-lg border border-transparent px-3 py-2 transition-colors hover:border-line-soft hover:bg-canvas/70\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-8px)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-ocean-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-ink-muted group-hover:text-ink\">Snap Hazards</span></li><li class=\"group flex items-start gap-2.5 rounded-lg border border-transparent px-3 py-2 transition-colors hover:border-line-soft hover:bg-canvas/70\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-8px)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-ocean-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-ink-muted group-hover:text-ink\">Reports — Incidents &amp; Near-Misses</span></li><li class=\"group flex items-start gap-2.5 rounded-lg border border-transparent px-3 py-2 transition-colors hover:border-line-soft hover:bg-canvas/70\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-8px)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-ocean-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-ink-muted group-hover:text-ink\">CAPA Management</span></li><li class=\"group flex items-start gap-2.5 rounded-lg border border-transparent px-3 py-2 transition-colors hover:border-line-soft hover:bg-canvas/70\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-8px)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-ocean-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-ink-muted group-hover:text-ink\">Bowtie Barriers</span></li><li class=\"group flex items-start gap-2.5 rounded-lg border border-transparent px-3 py-2 transition-colors hover:border-line-soft hover:bg-canvas/70\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-8px)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-ocean-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-ink-muted group-hover:text-ink\">Fishbone RCA</span></li><li class=\"group flex items-start gap-2.5 rounded-lg border border-transparent px-3 py-2 transition-colors hover:border-line-soft hover:bg-canvas/70\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-8px)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-ocean-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-ink-muted group-hover:text-ink\">Management of Change (MOC)</span></li><li class=\"group flex items-start gap-2.5 rounded-lg border border-transparent px-3 py-2 transition-colors hover:border-line-soft hover:bg-canvas/70\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-8px)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-ocean-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-ink-muted group-hover:text-ink\">PSC Pre-Arrival Readiness</span></li><li class=\"group flex items-start gap-2.5 rounded-lg border border-transparent px-3 py-2 transition-colors hover:border-line-soft hover:bg-canvas/70\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-8px)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-ocean-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-ink-muted group-hover:text-ink\">Permit to Work (PTW) with PIN-authenticated signatures</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"relative mt-8 flex items-start gap-3 rounded-xl bg-rail-900 px-5 py-4\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 size-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ocean-400\"></span><p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-white\">Outcome — </span>Every hazard has an owner, a barrier, and a closure record.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"knowledge\" class=\"relative py-24 sm:py-32\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 sm:px-8\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ocean-700\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-px w-8 bg-ocean-400\"></span>Knowledge &amp; Reference</p><h2 class=\"display mt-4 text-[2rem] leading-[1.12] tracking-tight sm:text-[2.6rem] text-ink\">Guidance, environmental reference, and archived proof</h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-ink-muted\">Competence walks off the gangway with every crew change. Knowledge &amp; Reference keeps the institutional memory in the system — so the fleet stays audit-ready and onboarding is faster.</p></div><div class=\"mt-14 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-6\"><div class=\"h-full lg:col-span-3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><div class=\"spotlight card card-interactive group h-full overflow-hidden p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4\"><span class=\"inline-flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-ocean-50 text-ocean-600 ring-1 ring-ocean-100 transition-colors group-hover:bg-ocean-600 group-hover:text-white group-hover:ring-ocean-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v16\"></path><path d=\"M20.001 19A2 2 0 0022 17V5a2 2 0 00-1.999-2L16 3.002A5 5 0 0012 5a5 5 0 00-4-2H4a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 001.999 2H8a5 5 0 014 2 5 5 0 014-2z\"></path></svg></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"display text-sm tracking-[0.2em] text-line\">01</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-6 text-lg font-semibold text-ink\">User Guide</h3><p class=\"mt-2 leading-7 text-ink-muted\">In-product operational guidance, so a new superintendent or a relieving Master can work the system correctly on day one instead of waiting for a trainer.</p></div></div><div class=\"h-full lg:col-span-3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><div class=\"spotlight card card-interactive group h-full overflow-hidden p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4\"><span class=\"inline-flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-ocean-50 text-ocean-600 ring-1 ring-ocean-100 transition-colors group-hover:bg-ocean-600 group-hover:text-white group-hover:ring-ocean-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-recycle size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 19H4.815a1.83 1.83 0 0 1-1.57-.881 1.785 1.785 0 0 1-.004-1.784L7.196 9.5\"></path><path d=\"M11 19h8.203a1.83 1.83 0 0 0 1.556-.89 1.784 1.784 0 0 0 0-1.775l-1.226-2.12\"></path><path d=\"m14 16-3 3 3 3\"></path><path d=\"M8.293 13.596 7.196 9.5 3.1 10.598\"></path><path d=\"m9.344 5.811 1.093-1.892A1.83 1.83 0 0 1 11.985 3a1.784 1.784 0 0 1 1.546.888l3.943 6.843\"></path><path d=\"m13.378 9.633 4.096 1.098 1.097-4.096\"></path></svg></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"display text-sm tracking-[0.2em] text-line\">02</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-6 text-lg font-semibold text-ink\">Waste Facilities directory</h3><p class=\"mt-2 leading-7 text-ink-muted\">Port reception facility reference kept beside the workflows that need it, supporting correct waste delivery decisions and MARPOL record keeping.</p></div></div><div class=\"h-full lg:col-span-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><div class=\"spotlight card card-interactive group h-full overflow-hidden p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4\"><span class=\"inline-flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-ocean-50 text-ocean-600 ring-1 ring-ocean-100 transition-colors group-hover:bg-ocean-600 group-hover:text-white group-hover:ring-ocean-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-archive size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"5\" x=\"2\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M4 8v11a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8\"></path><path d=\"M10 12h4\"></path></svg></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"display text-sm tracking-[0.2em] text-line\">03</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-6 text-lg font-semibold text-ink\">Compliance Archive</h3><p class=\"mt-2 leading-7 text-ink-muted\">Historical compliance evidence, searchable and exportable — the file an auditor asks for, retrieved in seconds rather than reconstructed from mailboxes.</p></div></div><div class=\"h-full lg:col-span-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><div class=\"spotlight card card-interactive group h-full overflow-hidden p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4\"><span class=\"inline-flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-ocean-50 text-ocean-600 ring-1 ring-ocean-100 transition-colors group-hover:bg-ocean-600 group-hover:text-white group-hover:ring-ocean-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-search size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path><circle cx=\"11.5\" cy=\"14.5\" r=\"2.5\"></circle><path d=\"M13.3 16.3 15 18\"></path></svg></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"display text-sm tracking-[0.2em] text-line\">04</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-6 text-lg font-semibold text-ink\">Audit Log Archive</h3><p class=\"mt-2 leading-7 text-ink-muted\">Traceability of audit and system activity: who did what, to which record, when, and under which revision.</p></div></div><div class=\"h-full lg:col-span-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><div class=\"spotlight card card-interactive group h-full overflow-hidden p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4\"><span class=\"inline-flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-ocean-50 text-ocean-600 ring-1 ring-ocean-100 transition-colors group-hover:bg-ocean-600 group-hover:text-white group-hover:ring-ocean-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-library size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m16 6 4 14\"></path><path d=\"M12 6v14\"></path><path d=\"M8 8v12\"></path><path d=\"M4 4v16\"></path></svg></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"display text-sm tracking-[0.2em] text-line\">05</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-6 text-lg font-semibold text-ink\">Knowledge &amp; Reference overview</h3><p class=\"mt-2 leading-7 text-ink-muted\">One hub tying guidance, reference data, and archives together.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"integrations\" class=\"border-y border-line bg-white py-24 sm:py-32\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 sm:px-8\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ocean-700\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-px w-8 bg-ocean-400\"></span>Smart integration &amp; migration</p><h2 class=\"display mt-4 text-[2rem] leading-[1.12] tracking-tight sm:text-[2.6rem] text-ink\">Bring fleet, crew, sea service, and certificates across without losing control</h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-ink-muted\">Most operators sit on spreadsheets and third-party tools, and a bad import is worse than no import. This prototype studies controlled migration: every route into Maridots goes through staging, validation, and review before anything becomes a record.</p></div><div class=\"mt-14 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.05fr] lg:gap-10\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><button aria-pressed=\"true\" class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border p-5 text-left transition-all border-ocean-300 bg-ocean-50/60 shadow-[0_18px_40px_-28px_rgba(2,132,199,0.8)]\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"inline-flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl ring-1 transition-colors bg-ocean-600 text-white ring-ocean-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-ship size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M12 9.189V13\"></path><path d=\"M19 12V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v6\"></path><path d=\"M19.38 19A11.6 11.6 0 0021 13l-8.188-3.639a2 2 0 00-1.624 0L3 13.001a11.6 11.6 0 002.81 7.76\"></path><path d=\"M2 20c.6.5 1.2 1 2.5 1 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 1.3 0 1.9.5 2.5 1s1.2 1 2.5 1c2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 1.3 0 1.9.5 2.5 1\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-ink\">Fleet Smart Onboarding</h3></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden\" style=\"height:auto;opacity:1\"><p class=\"pt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-muted\">Bulk import the fleet from Excel or CSV using the supplied template. Rows are staged, validated, and returned as an error report before anything is committed.</p><ul class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><li class=\"rounded-full bg-white px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-ocean-700 ring-1 ring-ocean-100\">Excel / CSV template</li><li class=\"rounded-full bg-white px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-ocean-700 ring-1 ring-ocean-100\">Staging area</li><li class=\"rounded-full bg-white px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-ocean-700 ring-1 ring-ocean-100\">Error report</li></ul></div></button><button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border p-5 text-left transition-all border-line bg-white hover:border-ocean-200\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"inline-flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl ring-1 transition-colors bg-canvas text-ocean-600 ring-line\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-user-check size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m16 11 2 2 4-4\"></path><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></span><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-ink\">Crew Directory bulk ingestion</h3></div></button><button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border p-5 text-left transition-all border-line bg-white hover:border-ocean-200\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"inline-flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl ring-1 transition-colors bg-canvas text-ocean-600 ring-line\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-spreadsheet size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path><path d=\"M8 13h2\"></path><path d=\"M14 13h2\"></path><path d=\"M8 17h2\"></path><path d=\"M14 17h2\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-ink\">Sea Experience / Sea Service import</h3></div></button><button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border p-5 text-left transition-all border-line bg-white hover:border-ocean-200\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"inline-flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl ring-1 transition-colors bg-canvas text-ocean-600 ring-line\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-scan-line size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 7V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"M17 3h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M21 17v2a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2\"></path><path d=\"M7 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2\"></path><path d=\"M7 12h10\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-ink\">Batch Certificate OCR ingestion</h3></div></button></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><div class=\"card sticky top-28 overflow-hidden\"><header class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-line bg-rail-900 px-5 py-4\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-white\">Migration staging — <!-- -->Fleet Smart Onboarding</p><span class=\"rounded-full bg-white/10 px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium text-ocean-200\">48 assets</span></header><div class=\"px-5 py-6\"><ol class=\"flex items-center\"><li class=\"flex flex-1 items-center last:flex-none\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"grid size-8 place-items-center rounded-full text-xs font-bold ring-1 transition-colors bg-ocean-600 text-white ring-ocean-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium text-ink\">Upload</span></div><div class=\"mx-1 mb-5 h-0.5 flex-1 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-line-soft\"><div class=\"h-full bg-ocean-500\" style=\"width:0%\"></div></div></li><li class=\"flex flex-1 items-center last:flex-none\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"grid size-8 place-items-center rounded-full text-xs font-bold ring-1 transition-colors bg-white text-ink-subtle ring-line\">2</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium text-ink-subtle\">Stage</span></div><div class=\"mx-1 mb-5 h-0.5 flex-1 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-line-soft\"><div class=\"h-full bg-ocean-500\" style=\"width:0%\"></div></div></li><li class=\"flex flex-1 items-center last:flex-none\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"grid size-8 place-items-center rounded-full text-xs font-bold ring-1 transition-colors bg-white text-ink-subtle ring-line\">3</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium text-ink-subtle\">Validate</span></div><div class=\"mx-1 mb-5 h-0.5 flex-1 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-line-soft\"><div class=\"h-full bg-ocean-500\" style=\"width:0%\"></div></div></li><li class=\"flex flex-1 items-center last:flex-none\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"grid size-8 place-items-center rounded-full text-xs font-bold ring-1 transition-colors bg-white text-ink-subtle ring-line\">4</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium text-ink-subtle\">Review</span></div><div class=\"mx-1 mb-5 h-0.5 flex-1 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-line-soft\"><div class=\"h-full bg-ocean-500\" style=\"width:0%\"></div></div></li><li class=\"flex flex-1 items-center last:flex-none\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"grid size-8 place-items-center rounded-full text-xs font-bold ring-1 transition-colors bg-white text-ink-subtle ring-line\">5</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium text-ink-subtle\">Commit</span></div></li></ol><div class=\"mt-7 space-y-3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-xl bg-canvas/70 px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm text-ink-muted\"><span class=\"size-2 rounded-full bg-rag-success\"></span>Accepted</span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-ink\">44 ready to commit</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-xl bg-canvas/70 px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm text-ink-muted\"><span class=\"size-2 rounded-full bg-rag-warning\"></span>Flagged</span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-ink\">4 need attention</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-xl bg-canvas/70 px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm text-ink-muted\"><span class=\"size-2 rounded-full bg-ocean-400\"></span>Validation</span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-ink\">IMO format and duplicate hull check</span></div></div><p class=\"mt-6 border-t border-line-soft pt-4 text-xs leading-5 text-ink-subtle\">Nothing reaches the live register until the flagged rows are resolved and the import is committed by a named user.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"dashboard\" class=\"mesh-dark relative isolate overflow-hidden py-24 sm:py-32\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"grid-fine-dark absolute inset-0 [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_60%_50%_at_50%_0%,#000,transparent_70%)]\"></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 sm:px-8\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ocean-300\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-px w-8 bg-ocean-400/60\"></span>Executive dashboard &amp; AI</p><h2 class=\"display mt-4 text-[2rem] leading-[1.12] tracking-tight sm:text-[2.6rem] text-white\">Executive dashboard with AI-assisted insight</h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300\">A research prototype exploring how fleet compliance and risk posture read at a glance — the system highlights what needs attention; accountable officers decide.</p></div><div class=\"mt-14 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1.3fr_0.7fr]\"><div class=\"min-w-0\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><div class=\"glass overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-[0_40px_80px_-50px_rgba(2,132,199,0.9)]\"><header class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-white/10 px-5 py-4\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-white\">Executive command preview</p><p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400\">Fleet-wide · rolling 90 days</p></div><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/10 px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium text-ocean-200 ring-1 ring-white/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-flask-conical size-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 .245.96l5.51 10.08A2 2 0 0 1 18 22H6a2 2 0 0 1-1.755-2.96l5.51-10.08A2 2 0 0 0 10 8V2\"></path><path d=\"M6.453 15h11.094\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 2h7\"></path></svg>R&amp;D prototype · illustrative data</span></header><div role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Dashboard view\" class=\"flex gap-1 overflow-x-auto border-b border-white/10 px-3 py-2\"><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" class=\"relative rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap transition-colors text-rail-900\"><span class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-ocean-300\"></span><span class=\"relative z-10\">Overview</span></button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"relative rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap transition-colors text-slate-300 hover:text-white\"><span class=\"relative z-10\">Compliance</span></button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"relative rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap transition-colors text-slate-300 hover:text-white\"><span class=\"relative z-10\">Risk</span></button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"relative rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap transition-colors text-slate-300 hover:text-white\"><span class=\"relative z-10\">Audits</span></button></div><div class=\"px-5 py-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px)\"><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.16em] text-slate-300 uppercase\">Certificate expiry horizon</p><p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400\">Statutory and class certificates, fleet-wide</p></div><div class=\"mt-3 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2.5\"><div class=\"rounded-xl px-3 py-3.5 ring-1 transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 bg-rag-danger/10 text-red-200 ring-rag-danger/30\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wider uppercase\">Critical<!-- --> · <!-- -->30 days</p><p class=\"display mt-1 text-3xl text-white tabular-nums\"><span>0</span></p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl px-3 py-3.5 ring-1 transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 bg-rag-warning/10 text-amber-200 ring-rag-warning/30\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wider uppercase\">Watch<!-- --> · <!-- -->60 days</p><p class=\"display mt-1 text-3xl text-white tabular-nums\"><span>0</span></p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl px-3 py-3.5 ring-1 transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 bg-rag-success/10 text-green-200 ring-rag-success/30\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wider uppercase\">Horizon<!-- --> · <!-- -->90 days</p><p class=\"display mt-1 text-3xl text-white tabular-nums\"><span>0</span></p></div></div><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[11px] leading-5 text-slate-400\">Counts are certificates falling due inside each window — the 60 and 90 day bands are planning horizons, the 30 day band needs action now.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] sm:items-center\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4\"><div class=\"flex shrink-0 flex-col items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"relative grid place-items-center\" style=\"width:104px;height:104px\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 128 128\" class=\"size-full -rotate-90\"><circle cx=\"64\" cy=\"64\" r=\"52\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"9\" class=\"stroke-white/10\"></circle><circle cx=\"64\" cy=\"64\" r=\"52\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke=\"#22c55e\" stroke-dasharray=\"326.7256359733385\" stroke-dashoffset=\"326.7256359733385\"></circle></svg><p class=\"display absolute text-2xl text-white tabular-nums\"><span>0<!-- -->%</span></p></div><p class=\"max-w-28 text-center text-[11px] leading-4 text-slate-400\">Fleet compliance</p></div><div class=\"flex shrink-0 flex-col items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"relative grid place-items-center\" style=\"width:104px;height:104px\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 128 128\" class=\"size-full -rotate-90\"><circle cx=\"64\" cy=\"64\" r=\"52\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"9\" class=\"stroke-white/10\"></circle><circle cx=\"64\" cy=\"64\" r=\"52\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-dasharray=\"326.7256359733385\" stroke-dashoffset=\"326.7256359733385\"></circle></svg><p class=\"display absolute text-2xl text-white tabular-nums\"><span>0<!-- -->%</span></p></div><p class=\"max-w-28 text-center text-[11px] leading-4 text-slate-400\">Crew compliance</p></div><div class=\"flex shrink-0 flex-col items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"relative grid place-items-center\" style=\"width:104px;height:104px\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 128 128\" class=\"size-full -rotate-90\"><circle cx=\"64\" cy=\"64\" r=\"52\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"9\" class=\"stroke-white/10\"></circle><circle cx=\"64\" cy=\"64\" r=\"52\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-dasharray=\"326.7256359733385\" stroke-dashoffset=\"326.7256359733385\"></circle></svg><p class=\"display absolute text-2xl text-white tabular-nums\"><span>0<!-- -->%</span></p></div><p class=\"max-w-28 text-center text-[11px] leading-4 text-slate-400\">Audit closure</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-3\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 104\" class=\"w-full\" style=\"height:104px\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Six-month fleet compliance trend, rising from 79 to 92 percent\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"area-overview\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#38bdf8\" stop-opacity=\"0.35\"></stop><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#38bdf8\" stop-opacity=\"0\"></stop></linearGradient></defs><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"320\" y1=\"26\" y2=\"26\" stroke=\"rgba(148,197,235,0.12)\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"320\" y1=\"52\" y2=\"52\" stroke=\"rgba(148,197,235,0.12)\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"320\" y1=\"78\" y2=\"78\" stroke=\"rgba(148,197,235,0.12)\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><path d=\"M0.0,65.7 L64.0,56.6 L128.0,59.6 L192.0,47.4 L256.0,38.3 L320.0,26.2 L320,104 L0,104 Z\" fill=\"url(#area-overview)\" style=\"opacity:0\"></path><path d=\"M0.0,65.7 L64.0,56.6 L128.0,59.6 L192.0,47.4 L256.0,38.3 L320.0,26.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\" pathLength=\"1\" stroke-dashoffset=\"0\" stroke-dasharray=\"0 1\"></path><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"26.160000000000004\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#38bdf8\"></circle></svg><div class=\"mt-1 flex justify-between text-[10px] text-slate-400\"><span>Apr</span><span>May</span><span>Jun</span><span>Jul</span><span>Aug</span><span>Sep</span></div></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-xl bg-rag-danger/10 px-4 py-3.5 ring-1 ring-rag-danger/30\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 inline-flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-rag-danger/20 text-red-200\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert lucide-alert-triangle size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg></span><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-white\">4 audits overdue across 3 vessels</p><p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-300\">Highest severity: annual internal ISM audit, 21 days past schedule</p></div></div><span class=\"rounded-full bg-rag-danger/20 px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wider text-red-200 uppercase\">Action required</span></div></div></div><footer class=\"border-t border-white/10 px-5 py-3\"><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-5 gap-y-1.5\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-slate-400\"><span class=\"size-2 rounded-full\" style=\"background-color:#22c55e\"></span>On track</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-slate-400\"><span class=\"size-2 rounded-full\" style=\"background-color:#f59e0b\"></span>Watch</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-slate-400\"><span class=\"size-2 rounded-full\" style=\"background-color:#ef4444\"></span>Action required</li></ul></footer></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><div class=\"glass flex h-full flex-col rounded-2xl p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"inline-flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-ocean-500/20 text-ocean-200 ring-1 ring-ocean-400/30\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bot size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 8V4H8\"></path><rect width=\"16\" height=\"12\" x=\"4\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M2 14h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 14h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 13v2\"></path><path d=\"M9 13v2\"></path></svg></span><div><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-white\">AI-assisted, not AI-decided</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">Every insight cites the records behind it</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-5 space-y-3\"><article class=\"group rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-rail-900/60 p-4 transition-colors hover:border-ocean-400/40\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px)\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wider uppercase ring-1 bg-rag-danger/15 text-red-200 ring-rag-danger/40\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-alert lucide-alert-circle size-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"8\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg>Critical</span><h4 class=\"mt-2.5 text-sm leading-6 font-semibold text-white\">Three certificates expire before a Paris MoU call</h4><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-[13px] leading-6 text-slate-300\">The vessel is scheduled into a high-inspection-rate port while statutory certificates lapse — the combination is what turns a finding into a detention.</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-[11px] text-slate-400\">Evidence: <!-- -->3 certificates · 1 asset · PSC pre-arrival schedule</p><p class=\"mt-2 flex items-start gap-1.5 border-t border-white/10 pt-2.5 text-[12px] leading-5 text-ocean-200\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg>Book renewal surveys before arrival, or re-sequence the port rotation</p></article><article class=\"group rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-rail-900/60 p-4 transition-colors hover:border-ocean-400/40\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px)\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wider uppercase ring-1 bg-rag-warning/15 text-amber-200 ring-rag-warning/40\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert lucide-alert-triangle size-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg>Watch</span><h4 class=\"mt-2.5 text-sm leading-6 font-semibold text-white\">Mooring barrier health is trending down fleet-wide</h4><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-[13px] leading-6 text-slate-300\">Barrier condition has fallen across four vessels this quarter. A shared decline points at a fleet procedure rather than four isolated findings.</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-[11px] text-slate-400\">Evidence: <!-- -->4 bowtie models · 11 findings · 6-month trend</p><p class=\"mt-2 flex items-start gap-1.5 border-t border-white/10 pt-2.5 text-[12px] leading-5 text-ocean-200\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg>Raise a Management of Change review on the mooring procedure</p></article><article class=\"group rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-rail-900/60 p-4 transition-colors hover:border-ocean-400/40\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px)\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wider uppercase ring-1 bg-ocean-400/15 text-ocean-200 ring-ocean-400/40\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-info size-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg>Info</span><h4 class=\"mt-2.5 text-sm leading-6 font-semibold text-white\">Audit closure is slipping in one operating unit</h4><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-[13px] leading-6 text-slate-300\">Closure rate sits 11 points below the fleet average. The delay is in verification evidence, not in the corrective work itself.</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-[11px] text-slate-400\">Evidence: <!-- -->18 audits · 1 operating unit</p><p class=\"mt-2 flex items-start gap-1.5 border-t border-white/10 pt-2.5 text-[12px] leading-5 text-ocean-200\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg>Ask the unit QM to attach closure evidence at verification</p></article></div><p class=\"mt-5 text-[11px] leading-5 text-slate-400\">The DPA or Quality Manager accepts, dismisses, or escalates each insight. Maridots orders the queue; the accountable officer decides.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"security\" class=\"relative py-24 sm:py-32\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 sm:px-8\"><div class=\"grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.85fr_1fr] lg:items-start lg:gap-16\"><div class=\"lg:sticky lg:top-28\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"mb-6 size-16 mix-blend-multiply\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fmaridots-shield.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fmaridots-shield.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fmaridots-shield.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"max-w-3xl\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ocean-700\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-px w-8 bg-ocean-400\"></span>Security &amp; monitoring</p><h2 class=\"display mt-4 text-[2rem] leading-[1.12] tracking-tight sm:text-[2.6rem] text-ink\">Controlled access, signed approvals, provable history</h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-ink-muted\">Compliance data is liability data. It has to be restricted to the right people, attributable to a named approver, and impossible to quietly revise after the fact.</p></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><div class=\"mt-8 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-line shadow-[0_30px_60px_-45px_rgba(15,23,42,0.7)]\"><img alt=\"An officer reviewing certificates and audit evidence beside a compliance dashboard\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1024px) 38vw, 100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Faudit-evidence.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Faudit-evidence.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Faudit-evidence.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Faudit-evidence.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Faudit-evidence.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Faudit-evidence.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Faudit-evidence.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Faudit-evidence.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Faudit-evidence.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Faudit-evidence.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Faudit-evidence.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"h-full\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><div class=\"spotlight card card-interactive h-full p-6\"><article><span class=\"inline-flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-rail-900 text-ocean-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-semibold text-ink\">Role-based permissions</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-muted\">Crew, Master, DPA, quality manager, superintendent, and external auditor each see the records their role requires and nothing beyond it. Bureau users are scoped to the client engagement they are appointed to.</p></article></div></div><div class=\"h-full\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><div class=\"spotlight card card-interactive h-full p-6\"><article><span class=\"inline-flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-rail-900 text-ocean-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-key-round size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.586 17.414A2 2 0 0 0 2 18.828V21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h.172a2 2 0 0 0 1.414-.586l.814-.814a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-4-4z\"></path><circle cx=\"16.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-semibold text-ink\">PIN-authenticated signatures</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-muted\">High-liability workflows — permits to work, audit sign-off, CAPA verification — are approved with an authenticated digital signature binding the approver, the time, and the document version.</p></article></div></div><div class=\"h-full\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><div class=\"spotlight card card-interactive h-full p-6\"><article><span class=\"inline-flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-rail-900 text-ocean-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-archive size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"5\" x=\"2\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M4 8v11a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8\"></path><path d=\"M10 12h4\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-semibold text-ink\">Traceability and archives</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-muted\">Records are append-only. Revisions, approvals, and closures remain retrievable with full attribution, which is what turns a claim of compliance into evidence of it.</p></article></div></div><div class=\"h-full\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><div class=\"spotlight card card-interactive h-full p-6\"><article><span class=\"inline-flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-rail-900 text-ocean-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bell-ring size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.268 21a2 2 0 0 0 3.464 0\"></path><path d=\"M22 8c0-2.3-.8-4.3-2-6\"></path><path d=\"M3.262 15.326A1 1 0 0 0 4 17h16a1 1 0 0 0 .74-1.673C19.41 13.956 18 12.499 18 8A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 4.499-1.411 5.956-2.738 7.326\"></path><path d=\"M4 2C2.8 3.7 2 5.7 2 8\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-semibold text-ink\">Continuous monitoring and alerts</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-muted\">Expiry horizons, overdue actions, rest hour breaches, and open permits are monitored continuously, with alerts directed to the role accountable for acting on them.</p></article></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"support\" class=\"border-y border-line bg-white py-24 sm:py-32\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 sm:px-8\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] justify-center text-ocean-700\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-px w-8 bg-ocean-400\"></span>Enablement research</p><h2 class=\"display mt-4 text-[2rem] leading-[1.12] tracking-tight sm:text-[2.6rem] text-ink\">The human half of the problem</h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-ink-muted\">A safety management system only works if the people using it at sea and ashore trust it. Alongside the software prototypes, we are researching how that trust is built — the questions below are open, and practitioner input shapes them.</p></div><div class=\"relative mt-16\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute top-14 right-[16%] left-[16%] hidden h-px bg-linear-to-r from-transparent via-ocean-200 to-transparent lg:block\"></div><div class=\"grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"h-full\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><div class=\"spotlight card card-interactive relative h-full p-7 text-center\"><span class=\"relative z-10 mx-auto inline-flex size-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-white text-ocean-600 shadow-[0_10px_30px_-16px_rgba(2,132,199,0.8)] ring-1 ring-ocean-100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-life-buoy size-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m4.93 4.93 4.24 4.24\"></path><path d=\"m14.83 9.17 4.24-4.24\"></path><path d=\"m14.83 14.83 4.24 4.24\"></path><path d=\"m9.17 14.83-4.24 4.24\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></span><p class=\"mt-5 text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.16em] text-ocean-700 uppercase\">Research theme</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-ink\">Adoption and support models</h3><p class=\"mt-3 leading-7 text-ink-muted\">How does a safety management system stay usable after the first month? We are studying what shore teams actually need when configurations change, operating units are added, and questions come back from the vessel.</p></div></div><div class=\"h-full\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><div class=\"spotlight card card-interactive relative h-full p-7 text-center\"><span class=\"relative z-10 mx-auto inline-flex size-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-white text-ocean-600 shadow-[0_10px_30px_-16px_rgba(2,132,199,0.8)] ring-1 ring-ocean-100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-graduation-cap size-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z\"></path><path d=\"M22 10v6\"></path><path d=\"M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5\"></path></svg></span><p class=\"mt-5 text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.16em] text-ocean-700 uppercase\">Shore &amp; vessel</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-ink\">Training format studies</h3><p class=\"mt-3 leading-7 text-ink-muted\">Two audiences, two problems: shore users working audits, CAPA, and certificate control, and vessel users capturing hazards, permits, and rest hours at the point of work. We are testing which formats hold up for each.</p></div></div><div class=\"h-full\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><div class=\"spotlight card card-interactive relative h-full p-7 text-center\"><span class=\"relative z-10 mx-auto inline-flex size-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-white text-ocean-600 shadow-[0_10px_30px_-16px_rgba(2,132,199,0.8)] ring-1 ring-ocean-100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-refresh-cw size-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1 6.74 2.74L21 8\"></path><path d=\"M21 3v5h-5\"></path><path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 0 1-9 9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1-6.74-2.74L3 16\"></path><path d=\"M8 16H3v5\"></path></svg></span><p class=\"mt-5 text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.16em] text-ocean-700 uppercase\">Longitudinal</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-ink\">Competence retention</h3><p class=\"mt-3 leading-7 text-ink-muted\">Regulations move, workflows change, and crew rotate through the fleet. Part of the research asks how competence is kept current over time rather than assumed at handover.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"relative py-24 sm:py-32\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 sm:px-8\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] justify-center text-ocean-700\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-px w-8 bg-ocean-400\"></span>Who this research is for</p><h2 class=\"display mt-4 text-[2rem] leading-[1.12] tracking-tight sm:text-[2.6rem] text-ink\">Two evaluation perspectives, one architecture</h2></div><div class=\"mx-auto mt-14 grid max-w-4xl gap-6 md:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"h-full\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><div class=\"spotlight card card-interactive group h-full overflow-hidden p-7\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute -top-16 -right-10 size-40 rounded-full bg-ocean-100/60 opacity-0 blur-3xl transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100\"></div><span class=\"inline-flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-ocean-50 text-ocean-600 ring-1 ring-ocean-100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-ship size-5.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M12 9.189V13\"></path><path d=\"M19 12V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v6\"></path><path d=\"M19.38 19A11.6 11.6 0 0021 13l-8.188-3.639a2 2 0 00-1.624 0L3 13.001a11.6 11.6 0 002.81 7.76\"></path><path d=\"M2 20c.6.5 1.2 1 2.5 1 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 1.3 0 1.9.5 2.5 1s1.2 1 2.5 1c2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 1.3 0 1.9.5 2.5 1\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-5 text-xl font-semibold text-ink\">Fleet evaluation perspective</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 leading-7 text-ink-muted\">Technical review from the shore and vessel side: how certificate control, audits, CAPA, and permits would sit in an operator&#x27;s safety management architecture.</p><ul class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2 border-t border-line-soft pt-5\"><li class=\"rounded-full bg-canvas px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted ring-1 ring-line\">Shipowners</li><li class=\"rounded-full bg-canvas px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted ring-1 ring-line\">Fleet managers</li><li class=\"rounded-full bg-canvas px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted ring-1 ring-line\">DPA</li><li class=\"rounded-full bg-canvas px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted ring-1 ring-line\">Quality &amp; HSE</li><li class=\"rounded-full bg-canvas px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted ring-1 ring-line\">Masters</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"h-full\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><div class=\"spotlight card card-interactive group h-full overflow-hidden p-7\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute -top-16 -right-10 size-40 rounded-full bg-ocean-100/60 opacity-0 blur-3xl transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100\"></div><span class=\"inline-flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-ocean-50 text-ocean-600 ring-1 ring-ocean-100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-building size-5.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 10h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 14h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 6h.01\"></path><path d=\"M16 10h.01\"></path><path d=\"M16 14h.01\"></path><path d=\"M16 6h.01\"></path><path d=\"M8 10h.01\"></path><path d=\"M8 14h.01\"></path><path d=\"M8 6h.01\"></path><path d=\"M9 22v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h4a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><rect x=\"4\" y=\"2\" width=\"16\" height=\"20\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-5 text-xl font-semibold text-ink\">Bureau evaluation perspective</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 leading-7 text-ink-muted\">Architectural review from the consultancy and audit side: multi-fleet scoping, templates, calendars, and isolated engagement workspaces across evaluation portfolios.</p><ul class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2 border-t border-line-soft pt-5\"><li class=\"rounded-full bg-canvas px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted ring-1 ring-line\">Bureau directors</li><li class=\"rounded-full bg-canvas px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted ring-1 ring-line\">Lead auditors</li><li class=\"rounded-full bg-canvas px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted ring-1 ring-line\">External inspectors</li><li class=\"rounded-full bg-canvas px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted ring-1 ring-line\">Engagement leads</li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"plans\" class=\"relative py-24 sm:py-32\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 sm:px-8\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ocean-700\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-px w-8 bg-ocean-400\"></span>Collaboration</p><h2 class=\"display mt-4 text-[2rem] leading-[1.12] tracking-tight sm:text-[2.6rem] text-ink\">No prices, no licences — just research conversations</h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-ink-muted\">Maridots is not sold, licensed, or subscribed to. There is no price list, no checkout, and no commercial offering behind this page. What varies is the shape of the conversation: how much of the prototype is worth reviewing with you, and how deep the technical exchange goes.</p></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-6\"><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><li class=\"rounded-full bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-ink-muted ring-1 ring-line\">Fleet profile and vessel types</li><li class=\"rounded-full bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-ink-muted ring-1 ring-line\">Prototypes in scope</li><li class=\"rounded-full bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-ink-muted ring-1 ring-line\">Shore and vessel workflows reviewed</li><li class=\"rounded-full bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-ink-muted ring-1 ring-line\">Depth and length of the exchange</li></ul><div class=\"flex gap-1 rounded-full bg-white p-1 ring-1 ring-line\"><button aria-pressed=\"true\" class=\"relative rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold transition-colors text-white\"><span class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-ocean-600\"></span><span class=\"relative z-10\">Fleet operator</span></button><button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"relative rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold transition-colors text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\"><span class=\"relative z-10\">Consultancy bureau</span></button></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-10 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"h-full\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><div class=\"spotlight card card-interactive flex h-full flex-col p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3\"><h3 class=\"display text-xl text-ink\">Focused review</h3></div><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-muted\">A short exchange on one problem area — usually certificate control or the audit cycle.</p><ul class=\"mt-6 flex-1 gap-3 border-t border-line-soft pt-6 space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-ocean-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-ink-muted\">Asset register and certificate matrix</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-ocean-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-ink-muted\">Audit schedules and findings</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-ocean-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-ink-muted\">Snap Hazards and CAPA</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-ocean-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-ink-muted\">Written notes back to you</span></li></ul><p class=\"mt-6 text-sm font-medium text-ink\">No charge · no licence · no obligation</p></div></div><div class=\"h-full\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><div class=\"spotlight card card-interactive flex h-full flex-col p-7 border-ocean-300 ring-1 ring-ocean-200\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3\"><h3 class=\"display text-xl text-ink\">Full prototype review</h3><span class=\"rounded-full bg-ocean-600 px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-wider text-white uppercase\">Most requested</span></div><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-muted\">A longer session across the compliance and risk chain as it currently stands.</p><ul class=\"mt-6 flex-1 gap-3 border-t border-line-soft pt-6 space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-ocean-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-ink-muted\">Everything in a focused review</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-ocean-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-ink-muted\">Crewing, rest hours, and PTW</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-ocean-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-ink-muted\">Bowtie, Fishbone RCA, and MOC</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-ocean-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-ink-muted\">Executive dashboard and alerts</span></li></ul><p class=\"mt-6 text-sm font-medium text-ink\">No charge · no licence · no obligation</p></div></div><div class=\"h-full\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><div class=\"spotlight card card-interactive flex h-full flex-col p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3\"><h3 class=\"display text-xl text-ink\">Architecture discussion</h3></div><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-muted\">A technical exchange for teams interested in the engineering rather than the screens.</p><ul class=\"mt-6 flex-1 gap-3 border-t border-line-soft pt-6 space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-ocean-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-ink-muted\">Everything in a full prototype review</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-ocean-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-ink-muted\">Data model and migration approach</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-ocean-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-ink-muted\">Multi-tenant scoping and RBAC design</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-ocean-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-ink-muted\">Direct exchange with the engineering side</span></li></ul><p class=\"mt-6 text-sm font-medium text-ink\">No charge · no licence · no obligation</p></div></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><div class=\"mesh-dark relative mt-12 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-6 overflow-hidden rounded-3xl px-8 py-10\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"grid-fine-dark absolute inset-0 [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_60%_80%_at_20%_50%,#000,transparent_70%)]\"></div><div class=\"relative max-w-xl\"><p class=\"display text-2xl leading-snug text-white sm:text-3xl\">Tell us how your fleet works — we&#x27;ll show you what we built and listen</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300\">Write to info@maridots.com and describe the operation you run. What follows is a technical conversation about the prototypes, not a sales process — nothing is quoted, sold, or contracted through this site.</p></div><a href=\"mailto:info@maridots.com\" class=\"group relative inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-rail-900 transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5\">Email the research team<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section id=\"contact\" class=\"border-t border-line bg-white py-24 sm:py-32\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 sm:px-8\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ocean-700\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-px w-8 bg-ocean-400\"></span>Contact</p><h2 class=\"display mt-4 text-[2rem] leading-[1.12] tracking-tight sm:text-[2.6rem] text-ink\">Start a research conversation</h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-ink-muted\">Write to info@maridots.com, or leave your details below. Inquiries, technical evaluation discussions, and pilot feedback are processed directly by the international team — with administrative oversight in Tunisia — via that mailbox. Every message is answered personally; there is no sales pipeline.</p></div><div class=\"mt-14 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_1fr] lg:gap-12\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><div class=\"card overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-line bg-canvas/70 px-7 py-4\"><span class=\"size-2 rounded-full bg-rag-success\"></span><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-ink-muted\">International team · info@maridots.com</p></div><div class=\"p-7 sm:p-8\"><form noValidate=\"\" class=\"grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2\"><label class=\"text-sm\"><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">Full name<!-- --> <span class=\"text-rag-danger\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></span><input type=\"text\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"Elena Moros\" aria-invalid=\"false\" autoComplete=\"name\" class=\"input mt-1.5\" name=\"fullName\"/></label><label class=\"text-sm\"><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">Company<!-- --> <span class=\"text-rag-danger\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></span><input type=\"text\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"Aegean Bulk Carriers\" aria-invalid=\"false\" autoComplete=\"organization\" class=\"input mt-1.5\" name=\"company\"/></label><label class=\"text-sm\"><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">Role <span class=\"text-rag-danger\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></span><select name=\"role\" required=\"\" aria-invalid=\"false\" class=\"input mt-1.5\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\" selected=\"\">Select your role</option><option value=\"Shipowner / Executive\">Shipowner / Executive</option><option value=\"Fleet Manager\">Fleet Manager</option><option value=\"DPA (Designated Person Ashore)\">DPA (Designated Person Ashore)</option><option value=\"Quality / HSE Manager\">Quality / HSE Manager</option><option value=\"Master / Deck Officer\">Master / Deck Officer</option><option value=\"Consultancy Bureau / Auditor\">Consultancy Bureau / Auditor</option><option value=\"Other\">Other</option></select></label><label class=\"text-sm\"><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">Work email<!-- --> <span class=\"text-rag-danger\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></span><input type=\"email\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"e.moros@company.com\" aria-invalid=\"false\" autoComplete=\"email\" class=\"input mt-1.5\" name=\"email\"/></label><label class=\"text-sm\"><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">Phone<!-- --> </span><input type=\"tel\" placeholder=\"Optional\" aria-invalid=\"false\" autoComplete=\"tel\" class=\"input mt-1.5\" name=\"phone\"/></label><label class=\"text-sm\"><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">Fleet size</span><select name=\"fleetSize\" class=\"input mt-1.5\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Optional</option><option value=\"1–5 vessels\">1–5 vessels</option><option value=\"6–15 vessels\">6–15 vessels</option><option value=\"16–40 vessels\">16–40 vessels</option><option value=\"40+ vessels\">40+ vessels</option><option value=\"Consultancy bureau (multiple clients)\">Consultancy bureau (multiple clients)</option></select></label><label class=\"text-sm sm:col-span-2\"><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">Message <span class=\"text-rag-danger\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></span><textarea name=\"message\" required=\"\" rows=\"5\" aria-invalid=\"false\" placeholder=\"12 bulk carriers, ISM audit in March, certificates tracked in spreadsheets and CAPA closure slipping. Happy to look at the risk and audit prototypes and give you feedback.\" class=\"input mt-1.5 resize-y\"></textarea></label><div class=\"hidden\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label>Website<input type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autoComplete=\"off\" name=\"website\"/></label></div><div class=\"sm:col-span-2\"><label class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm\"><input type=\"checkbox\" required=\"\" aria-invalid=\"false\" class=\"mt-0.5 size-4 rounded border-line accent-[#0284c7]\" name=\"consent\"/><span class=\"text-ink-muted\">I agree that Maridots may store these details and reply to me about this research enquiry. <span class=\"text-rag-danger\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></span></label></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 sm:col-span-2\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-ocean-600 px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-[0_18px_40px_-18px_rgba(2,132,199,0.9)] transition-colors hover:bg-ocean-700 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-70\">Send message<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-send size-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.5-19a.496.496 0 0 0-.635-.635l-19 6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.024.937l7.93 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 1.112 1.11z\"></path><path d=\"m21.854 2.147-10.94 10.939\"></path></svg></button><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-subtle\">Your details are never shared.</p></div></form></div></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)\"><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"mesh-dark relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl p-7\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"grid-fine-dark absolute inset-0 [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_70%_60%_at_80%_0%,#000,transparent_70%)]\"></div><div class=\"relative\"><h3 class=\"display text-xl text-white\">Maridots</h3><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-400\">Streamline Compliance. Safeguard Your Assets.</p><ul class=\"mt-6 space-y-4 text-sm\"><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 inline-flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-white/10 text-ocean-200 ring-1 ring-white/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></span><div><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] text-slate-400 uppercase\">Email</p><p class=\"mt-1 leading-6 text-white\"><a href=\"mailto:info@maridots.com\" class=\"text-ocean-200 hover:text-white\">info@maridots.com</a></p></div></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 inline-flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-white/10 text-ocean-200 ring-1 ring-white/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg></span><div><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] text-slate-400 uppercase\">Web</p><p class=\"mt-1 leading-6 text-white\"><a href=\"https://maridots.com\" class=\"text-ocean-200 hover:text-white\">maridots.com</a></p></div></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"card p-7\"><span class=\"inline-flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-ocean-50 text-ocean-600 ring-1 ring-ocean-100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-flask-conical size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 .245.96l5.51 10.08A2 2 0 0 1 18 22H6a2 2 0 0 1-1.755-2.96l5.51-10.08A2 2 0 0 0 10 8V2\"></path><path d=\"M6.453 15h11.094\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 2h7\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-semibold text-ink\">International team · human reply only</h3><p class=\"mt-2 leading-7 text-ink-muted\">Maridots is an international cross-border research initiative with administrative oversight in Tunisia. The prototypes are not for sale, licence, or subscription. No transaction can be made through this site — just a private technical exchange with the international team at info@maridots.com.</p><a class=\"mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-ocean-700 underline-offset-4 hover:underline\" href=\"/notice\">Read the research notice<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"border-t border-line bg-rail-900\"><div class=\"border-b border-white/10\"><ul class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-wrap items-center gap-x-8 gap-y-3 px-5 py-5 sm:px-8\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-slate-400\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"size-1.5 rounded-full bg-ocean-400\"></span>Compliance</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-slate-400\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"size-1.5 rounded-full bg-ocean-400\"></span>Offline audits</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-slate-400\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"size-1.5 rounded-full bg-ocean-400\"></span>Risk management</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-slate-400\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"size-1.5 rounded-full bg-ocean-400\"></span>High flexibility</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-slate-400\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"size-1.5 rounded-full bg-ocean-400\"></span>Appreciated security</li></ul></div><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-8\"><div class=\"grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.3fr_2fr]\"><div><img alt=\"Maridots\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"280\" height=\"280\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-28 w-auto rounded-xl bg-white p-2 sm:h-32\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogo.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Flogo.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogo.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75\"/><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-sm text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400\">An international cross-border technology research initiative into maritime compliance and risk architecture, jointly developed and managed with administrative oversight in Tunisia. Inquiries are handled by the international team at info@maridots.com.</p><ul class=\"mt-6 space-y-2.5 text-sm text-slate-400\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail size-4 shrink-0 text-ocean-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><a href=\"mailto:info@maridots.com\" class=\"hover:text-white\">info@maridots.com</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-3\"><div><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-slate-500\">Research</p><ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-2.5\"><li><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/#solution\">Solution</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/#modules\">Modules</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/#knowledge\">Knowledge &amp; Reference</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/#integrations\">Integrations &amp; migration</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/#dashboard\">Executive dashboard &amp; AI</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/#security\">Security &amp; monitoring</a></li></ul></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-slate-500\">Initiative</p><ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-2.5\"><li><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/#support\">Enablement research</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/#plans\">Collaboration</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/#contact\">Write to the research team</a></li></ul></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-slate-500\">Legal</p><ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-2.5\"><li><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/privacy\">Privacy notice</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/notice\">Research notice</a></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-14 flex flex-col gap-3 border-t border-white/10 pt-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\"><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> Maridots. All rights reserved.</p><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">International research · Tunisia administrative oversight · not a commercial offering.</p></div></div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3s6nzrbk-8mnv.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[80207,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/16a_74cium-hd.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1xpk765hxy3j2.js\\\"],\\\"SiteHeader\\\"]\\n9:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2ew-m63tr2c--.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/47df9ba1c7236d3b-s.p.137759vg1sbmi.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/68d403cf9f2c68c5-s.p.20at88_q9f_kt.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\